        "49",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "2ea7b2154a615a57c1cd6a201e86a21518788ee89c5c0b35dece74a93f3b22f1",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "意味などなさそうな探しもののはてに、それでも %YOU% は、誰かにこっそり見られている。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c1d8437c8853e40680c9518ca930f7fa",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "8d38433b20662339b9cc9673eb9beeb72f2dc1689f407b20a79bfaa2199b5d4c",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "そう……言い添えるなら、悪意のある視線ではないだろう。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "996c89d4523c89ef67145158bbebf350",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "5523c59755aa0209d543aaf1f99b64c010875fb05228595ee02ab9568825562b",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "たとえるなら、猫の舌、だろうか。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8fa4222d847579c83cb25b7fe89af718",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "45de100c73472bd4f4633b5f875537ffd69837dafd3a776905e8acfd21f1f6a8",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "柔らかく……温かく……だが肌をくすぐる、しなやかな逆棘がある。いつのまにか絡みつかれ、背後へ潜られている感触も、よく似ている。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b09470c5efeb337663ee3d1bc61d422d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "49",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "49",
        "lines",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "f817d6e67335cdf4f7069eb4c708c41ddf3eafbcbaad83b6b13ced3a7475dfbf",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "女神さまに、祈ってみようか……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "03c0b5162b9e41efeca5a81dedf9f29f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "title"
      ],
      "originalHash": "d03d408a28076cc9f48e7410ac5946d3f7252dad8997ce30f428a8d6375191d6",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "「まなざし」と狩り",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "893dd7fdadfa6378c19411ad4c62a8f2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "bfef9a01e61e84a1bb3463c816f29ad9af561f228ab9f558640da488c2a92910",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "軽やかに、しなやかに、ベッドへ攀じ上る。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "c226d07aefde24c81c9409c5bf82778f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "bee48421ea47ebb58eddc22ef8e6204736d0a794a4e6e5d9bbc1dbf17389d483",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "両手を突いて、%YOU% をその下に固定する。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f1404c5b8ba5d24f68a75d933121d9dc",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "3e1e6826a825189f5831b8d0041137019a225e62e76841671c9fc7f86930ecee",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "どこから手をつけようかと値踏みするように、翠のまなざしが注がれる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ff087a3aebcbf698d39538f14af212dc",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "a3f5e75dfdc8c3d75255ec1da0d1745332c3cbe51ecc2a334a86d832097dba60",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "これも夢の一環なのだろうか……妙に淡い視点のまま、%YOU% は自室に、赤髪で小麦色の肌のウマ娘が増えているのを見る。雌豹のようにベッドの %YOU% へ覆い被さり、そして——口づけ……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9c47d98288a35237d3be687f87fdd864",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "b24250aed231be325f39835c0c87b23057c51ecbbab228545f5b3be93963b3c2",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "その先は……霧に沈むように……汗ばんで絡み合う、%YOURPHY%とウマ娘の身体……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "02c72c581e1abde6b0896b159e9d6798",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        5,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "a230d4cf5d4954543ebfeb774b36d880281b7036cc7c2228906c9a9d7a0e154d",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "冒涜（神の胤を宿らせる）",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d035707107761804ca3cae49439e91c9",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        5,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "aaf94cbb5d21807b3a230374dc250b79b2f313ac02946f1a526b751adf672283",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "夢の中であっても、眼前の、わけもなく気高いウマ娘を前にしても、身を屈めて下にいる理由などないはずだ！",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ff4a2913e1c3a435c0ecd3aa1f0c814d",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        5,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "d5fdd61cc19c8069e56872962489feeb4071508ff953fc7b7c06d429154e12ab",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "驚愕のまなざしの前で、込み上げる灼熱に理性を失った %YOU% と、ベッドの上で子羊のように弄ばれていた %YOU% の身体が重なる。濁った瞳を見開き、その両手を逆に捉えた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "076597b5f201d1bdacfa4ed161723ded",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        5,
        "lines",
        2,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "57ab1f621e99142f2420bbff74788a08ae23ea4c95793d668dcff1102a9e601a",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "激しく抗う身体と身体。褐色の女神は、己と同じ肌色の子の下に屈した。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8ace6662c027de47dd07fb3fda32b282",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        5,
        "lines",
        3,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "0b5ddcd566e6375d8ce2c2704eb293708e6f7908f6175910224d16ad7b3a7338",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "激しく抗う身体と身体。小麦色は、%YOURSKIN%に押し伏せられた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "968f5c3066933450373656930c4f1c7c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "95839211d93b798a39cde2d4fa2511e51ec4ad7843ffac283cf1802cf8397ae2",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "献身（%FUCKMEBUTTON%）",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ff505eb9556231146227ed4df764e83e",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "cf41d08d0a24d5da5b85e2d695355f709eb49a8f85aa7ba114bc45590b5a342b",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "抗う力が、まったくない。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3217d00a3865b94093cb7339193b462e",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "a6e20bfee458fdccbf36eeb6f52ca59c25f33f38468009450d79afe082671569",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "身体が、そう告げている。眼前のウマ娘は、疑いようもなく上位者なのだと。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "12d9d176b7a67fed43d3ea3d30bebbbb",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6,
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "28baf44edbe50782b6f0379305413fa557ed9e5d96d5bd56bab7d65a3a35896c",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "日頃は教え子として見ているウマ娘に、トレーナーとして押し伏せられる羞恥。ベッドに跨がれ、熟練の唇と舌に口づけを奪われ、眼前の狩人がそれでも止まない——",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "a7e0f8b17d50d84d088e7c0972b057dd",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        6,
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "9768d1d1a851a39ecad79b2446fdfd706073bbea8e96648ef5ddedafa199b974",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "%YOU% にできるのは、ただ、身を捧げること……だけ、だ……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "705e28124d831ed91a52c587aad946c9",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        7,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "73151facfb0494141a1db797ccb12641d55cd2ad99010efad49e93ae70bec85f",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "南無三",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9a5568183b3e03472b3ed8d99d3e33f2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        7,
        "lines",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "758ad494f32d6da4f38bc3ae6ef2077cf40bc9cbedc755074a38eb60dd788946",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "夢、だろう。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9c03f3440c006af6d375cd22738d6693",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        7,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "99d9261b8ba68c789189190598ba668c5791ac526bc292bd0bc0cb6aa7e51509",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "夢の中で夢だと気づくのは奇妙にも思えるが、いま %YOU% が %YOU% と彼女を見つめているこの光景こそ、夢なのだろう。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ef8659545c91e41d6fc55908f6bbfe65",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        7,
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "50aa51014c8cd8652ac38ab2be8292247611260a93a462a8c57aaa350f0c555c",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "だから、こちらの唇がもう柔らかさを知っていても、あちらの%YOURSEX%と彼女がすでに裸で、艶めいていても、蛇のように滑らかな身体を絡め合っていても、",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "66a530d742e7996adbd80d3470e68edc",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "50",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "50",
        "lines",
        7,
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "7b811d0821b2f2d8711ad2303fefa519214f109708808a0601314f84b69184d3",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "ただ……祈り続ければ……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4d34766a5264feaf18ab83eafbe4736c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
      "key": "pray",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "pray",
        0
      ],
      "originalHash": "30cbb3c76b2170c19e1483e04fc7864d7f245b4283717762aa13e1727bad0acc",
      "sourceFileHash": "689b64261bbac9008df2789b2f6787d179b2fdde097f58f86ed4f9217da345ac",
      "originalText": "つい、%UMA%のように三女神像の下で祈ってしまった——放っておいてもいいような、甘えた願いではあるのだけれど。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "56080437927b70deb0d70814a9971f0c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ja-JP/kojo/904000-Darley-Arabian/love-340.kojo",
